{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "kyc-kyb-api-collection-v1",
		"name": "KYC/KYB System API Collection",
		"description": "Complete API collection for KYC/KYB microservices including Liveness Detection, AML Screening, and Risk Scoring services.\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll endpoints require OAuth2 Bearer token from Keycloak. Use the \"Get Auth Token\" request in the \"Authentication\" folder to obtain a token.\n\n## Services\n\n1. **Liveness Detection Service** (Port 8002) - 9 endpoints\n2. **AML Screening Service** (Port 8003) - 12 endpoints\n3. **Risk Scoring Service** (Port 8004) - 6 endpoints\n\n## Total: 27 API Endpoints\n\n## Variables\n\nSet the following collection variables:\n- `base_url`: http://localhost\n- `keycloak_url`: http://localhost:8080\n- `realm`: kyc-kyb-system\n- `username`: kyc_analyst\n- `password`: kyc123\n- `client_id`: liveness-service",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{access_token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get Auth Token (KYC Analyst)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", jsonData.access_token);",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", jsonData.refresh_token);",
									"    console.log(\"Access token saved to collection variable\");",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log(\"Failed to get token:\", pm.response.text());",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{
									"key": "username",
									"value": "{{username}}",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "password",
									"value": "{{password}}",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "grant_type",
									"value": "password",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "client_id",
									"value": "{{client_id}}",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{keycloak_url}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token",
							"host": [
								"{{keycloak_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"realms",
								"{{realm}}",
								"protocol",
								"openid-connect",
								"token"
							]
						},
						"description": "Get OAuth2 Bearer token from Keycloak for KYC Analyst role"
					},
					"response": []
				},
